{"action": "read_text", "data": {"field_path": "protocolSection.eligibilityModule.eligibilityCriteria", "record_id": "NCT05101642", "text": "Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Over 18 years of age\n* Systemically and periodontally healthy\n* Presence of isolated buccal Cairo RT1 gingival recessions\n* An identifiable CEJ\n* Affected teeth with at least 2mm attached gingiva.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Smokers\n* Pregnancy\n* Using antiepileptic drugs\n* Using antibiotics for at least 20 days before surgery"}, "params": {"field_path": "protocolSection.eligibilityModule.eligibilityCriteria", "record_id": "NCT05101642"}, "step": 2, "type": "observation"}
